<DIV tabIndex=-1 id=textbox038 class=hvg.textbox.1 style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; OVERFLOW: hidden; HEIGHT: 7.45%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; WIDTH: 85.54%; POSITION: absolute; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LEFT: 4.12%; TOP: 92.41%; BEHAVIOR: url(#HDXVectorFactory#text)" hdxproperties="fillColorBlink:False;FillStyle:1;Height:55;lineColorBlink:False;LineStyle:0;textColor:#000000;textColorBlink:False;TotalRotation:-1;Width:1160;" HDX_LOCK="-1">Readings&nbsp;21 to&nbsp;40 - RDISPDEGIMRCONN[X] - Degraded messages. Should show 0. Degraded messages count indicates that the display requests which are usually subscriptions, degraded to request response, because there were no buffers left. Indication for an overload</DIV>]]></content></html></element><element><html><content><![CDATA[
<DIV tabIndex=-1 id=textbox039 class=hvg.textbox.1 style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; OVERFLOW: hidden; HEIGHT: 9.89%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; WIDTH: 30.82%; POSITION: absolute; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LEFT: 6.56%; TOP: 33.46%; BEHAVIOR: url(#HDXVectorFactory#text)" hdxproperties="fillColorBlink:False;FillStyle:1;Height:73;lineColorBlink:False;LineStyle:0;textColor:#000000;textColorBlink:False;TotalRotation:-1;Width:418;" HDX_LOCK="-1">The CPU free should not fall under 20%. Low CPU could prevent CDA from having resource to maintain the connection to the server and console stations alive.</DIV>]]></content></html></element><element><html><content><![CDATA[
<DIV tabIndex=-1 id=textbox036 class=hvg.textbox.1 style="FONT-SIZE: 72pt; OVERFLOW: hidden; HEIGHT: 15.71%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; WIDTH: 18.87%; POSITION: absolute; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #808080; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LEFT: 11.79%; TOP: 46.88%; BEHAVIOR: url(#HDXVectorFactory#text)" hdxproperties="FillColor:transparent;fillColorBlink:False;FillStyle:1;Height:116;lineColorBlink:False;LineStyle:0;textColor:#808080;textColorBlink:False;TotalRotation:-1;Width:256;" HDX_LOCK="-1">C300</DIV>]]></content></html></element><element><html><content><![CDATA[<TEXTAREA tabIndex=0 id=ConLanAPauseCounts title="" class=hsc.alpha.1 style="BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; OVERFLOW: hidden; WORD-WRAP: normal; TEXT-DECORATION: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none; HEIGHT: 3.79%; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; WIDTH: 8.84%; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none; POSITION: absolute; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: #000000; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: right; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; LEFT: 38.05%; TOP: 62.05%; BEHAVIOR: url(#HDXAlphaBehavior) url(#BindingBehavior) url(#HoverBehavior); BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent; ROWS: 1" hdxproperties="fillColor:transparent;fillColorBlink:False;HDXBINDINGID:-4;lineColor:black;lineColorBlink:False;numericDisplayFormat:%.2f;textColor:#000000;textColorBlink:False;" HDX_LOCK="-1">9999.99</TEXTAREA>]]></content><scripts><script event="onupdate" language="VBScript"><![CDATA[on error resume next
